=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Devean} who will ask you to bet on how long it takes you to get a pair of {i:Power Sandals|Power Sandals|13012} from {z:Davoi}.
** The quicker you return, the more money you get back.
** The time is measured in game hours, not earth hours.
* Once in {z:Davoi} you need to locate a Jar that contains the {i:Power Sandals|Power Sandals|13012}.
** The jar can spawn at (I-8), (K-9), (J-8), (H-8), (F-6), (J-9), (F-9), (G-9), (H-9), and (F-7).
* Return the {i:Power Sandals|Power Sandals|13012} to {n:Devean} before time runs out.
* You can also choose to keep the {i:Power Sandals|Power Sandals|13012} for yourself. This however means that you will fail the quest.

